<section class="legal-page"><div class="container legal-card"><span class="eyebrow">Plain-language notice</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="lead">SmartCareer uses account and student profile details to provide secure access to the platform.</p><div class="notice-box">This page is a project-level summary and is not presented as a complete legal privacy policy.</div><h2>Information currently stored</h2><p>Your name, university, course, email address, account security information, and account creation date may be stored when you register.</p><h2>How it is used</h2><p>This information supports account access, student-role assignment, and the personalised experience already available in the application. SmartCareer does not display fabricated assessment or recommendation data.</p><h2>Your account</h2><p>Use the account settings available after sign-in to review supported account options. Contact details for formal privacy requests will be provided by the project administrator.</p></div></section>
